          "docs": "Load filter options dynamically for a given filter key.\n\nFor searchable filters (e.g. tags), supports ``search``, ``page``, and ``size``\nquery parameters for paginated search-as-you-type."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Admin Execute",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/api/v1/alerts/admin/rules/:rule_id/execute",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "rule_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Execute any alert/report rule on demand (admin only).\n\nRestricted to the service user (email matching SERVICE_USER_EMAIL).\nBypasses schedule and active/inactive status checks.\nDelegates to the Celery task for actual execution.\n\nRequires a `reason` (logged for audit) and accepts an optional\n`reference_time` to evaluate as if \"now\" were a different timestamp."
        }
      ]
